    <Program class="ca.nrcan.gc.OEE.ERS.ErsProgram">
        <Labels>
            <English>EnerGuide Rating System</English>
            <French>Système de cote ÉnerGuide</French>
        </Labels>
        <Version major="15" minor="5" build="8">
            <Labels>
                <English>v15.5b8</English>
                <French>v15.5b8</French>
            </Labels>
        </Version>
        <SdkVersion major="1" minor="16">
            <Labels>
                <English>v1.16</English>
                <French>v1.16</French>
            </Labels>
        </SdkVersion>
        <Options>
            <Main applyHouseholdOperatingConditions="false" applyReducedOperatingConditions="false" atypicalElectricalLoads="false" waterConservation="false" referenceHouse="false">
                <Vermiculite code="1">
                    <English>Unknown</English>
                    <French>Inconnu</French>
                </Vermiculite>
            </Main>
            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The program improved your air leakage rating by approximately 1.5 ACH which reducedthe heat loss from air leakage by about 27% for a savings of 9 GJ per year. Areas of air leakage include electrical outlets on the exterior walls, ceiling light fixtures, all the fresh air returns (probably air being drawn down through the furnace chimney), the studio window and a little bit throughtt he stove and bathroom fans.</airSeal>
                <ceilings>I added another R-20 of blown FG insulation to your attic which reduced heat loss through the attic by about 53% and 9 GJ per year.</ceilings>
                <windows>Replacing all your windows with triple glazed, lowE, argon filled windows saved14 GJ per yea and reduced heat loss through the windows by about 66%.</windows>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
